"prompt":"Birlik uchun qaysi gap mos?","answers":["That box is heavy."],"explanation":"That + birlik ot + is.","hint":"this book / these books; that box / those boxes","options":["That box is heavy.","Those box are heavy.","These box is heavy."]},{"id":"en-a1-05-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["These are my pens."],"explanation":"Ko‘p sanaladigan otlarda ko‘plik -s, ayrimlarida -es bilan yasaladi: books, boxes. Child → children, man → men kabi istisnolarni alohida o‘rganamiz. This/that birlik, these/those ko‘plik uchun ishlatiladi. This/these yaqin, that/those uzoqdagi narsani ko‘rsatadi. These books are new — ko‘plik uchun are. This book is new — birlik uchun is. Demonstrative va fe’l bir-biriga mos bo‘lsin.","hint":"this book / these books; that box / those boxes","tokens":["These","are","my","pens."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a1-05","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a1-05","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xs