audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-speak","name":"British Council — Speaking (A1–B2)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2"],"skill":"speaking","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/speaking","task":"Darajangizdagi video vaziyatidan ikki iborani o‘z dialogingizda ishlating.","lesson":"en-a2-11","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-listen","name":"British Council — Listening (A1–C1)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"listening","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening","task":"Mos daraja audiosini transkriptsiz tinglang; keyin yozuv bilan tekshiring.","lesson":"en-a2-11","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"cambridge","name":"Cambridge English — Activities","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"integrated","url":"https://www.cambridgeenglish.org/learning-english/activities-for-learners/","task":"A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-a2-11","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":false,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-a2-12','en-a2-12',null,2,12,'published',1,'{"id":"en-a2-12","baseId":"en-a2-12","revision":1,"level":"A2","levelIndex":2,"order":12,"title":"Ever, never, just, already va yet","objective":"Tajriba va ishning tugash holatini aniqlashtirasiz.","context":"Ekskursiyaga tayyorgarlikning so‘nggi ishlari tekshiriladi.","prerequisites":["en-a2-11"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Ever savollarda biror marta tajriba bo‘lganini, never esa hech qachon bo‘lmaganini aytadi: Have you ever flown?","Just hozirgina, already allaqachon, yet hali/gacha ma’noda inkor va savolda ko‘p uchraydi. Have just finished; haven’t finished yet.","Just/already ko‘pincha yordamchi bilan V3 orasida, yet odatda gap oxirida. Never bilan qo‘shimcha not ishlatilmaydi."],"pattern":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","examples":["Have you ever visited Khiva?","I have never flown.","She has just arrived.","We have already packed our bags.","He hasn’t called yet.","Have you bought the tickets yet?"],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-a2-12-v0","term":"pack","meaning":"joylamoq","ipa":"/pæk/","collocation":"pack a bag","example":"We have already packed our bags."},{"id":"en-a2-12-v1","term":"fly","meaning":"uchmoq","ipa":"/flaɪ/","collocation":"fly in a plane","example":"fly in a plane"},{"id":"en-a2-12-v2","term":"already","meaning":"allaqachon","ipa":"/ɔːlˈredi/","collocation":"already packed","example":"We have already packed our bags."},{"id":"en-a2-12-v3","term":"yet","meaning":"hali, shu vaqtgacha","ipa":"/jet/","collocation":"not yet","example":"He hasn’t called yet."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"sentence","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","Have you ever visited Khiva?","I have never flown."]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Ekskursiyaga tayyorgarlikning so‘nggi ishlari tekshiriladi.","She has just arrived.","He hasn’t called yet."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"We have already packed our bags.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-12-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-a2-12-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Inkor gap oxiriga mos so‘z?","answers":["yet"],"explanation":"Haven’t called yet.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","options":["yet","already always","ever never"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"She has ___ arrived. (hozirgina)","answers":["just"],"explanation":"Ever savollarda biror marta tajriba bo‘lganini, never esa hech qachon bo‘lmaganini aytadi: Have you ever flown? Just hozirgina, already allaqachon, yet hali/gacha ma’noda inkor va savolda ko‘p uchraydi. Have just finished; haven’t finished yet. Just/already ko‘pincha yordamchi bilan V3 orasida, yet odatda gap oxirida. Never bilan qo‘shimcha not ishlatilmaydi.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet"},{"id":"en-a2-12-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["Have you ever visited Khiva?"],"explanation":"Ever savollarda biror marta tajriba bo‘lganini, never esa hech qachon bo‘lmaganini aytadi: Have you ever flown? Just hozirgina, already allaqachon, yet hali/gacha ma’noda inkor va savolda ko‘p uchraydi. Have just finished; haven’t finished yet. Just/already ko‘pincha yordamchi bilan V3 orasida, yet odatda gap oxirida. Never bilan qo‘shimcha not ishlatilmaydi.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","tokens":["Have","you","ever","visited","Khiva?"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I haven’t never flown.","answers":["I have never flown."],"explanation":"Ever savollarda biror marta tajriba bo‘lganini, never esa hech qachon bo‘lmaganini aytadi: Have you ever flown? Just hozirgina, already allaqachon, yet hali/gacha ma’noda inkor va savolda ko‘p uchraydi. Have just finished; haven’t finished yet. Just/already ko‘pincha yordamchi bilan V3 orasida, yet odatda gap oxirida. Never bilan qo‘shimcha not ishlatilmaydi.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet"},{"id":"en-a2-12-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["joylamoq","uchmoq","allaqachon","hali, shu vaqtgacha"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","left":["pack","fly","already","yet"],"options":["joylamoq","uchmoq","allaqachon","hali, shu vaqtgacha"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-collocations","type":"collocation","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni darsdagi birikmasi bilan moslang.","left":["pack","fly","already","yet"],"options":["pack a bag","fly in a plane","already packed","not yet"],"answers":["pack a bag","fly in a plane","already packed","not yet"],"hint":"So‘z qaysi birikmada ishlatilishini eslang.","explanation":"Birikmani yozgan gapingizda ham ishlating."},{"id":"en-a2-12-dialogue","type":"dialogue","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Sherik: “Can you give one example?” Siz: darsdagi birinchi namunani qayta tuzing.","answers":["Have you ever visited Khiva?"],"tokens":["Have","you","ever","visited","Khiva?"],"hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","explanation":"Ever savollarda biror marta tajriba bo‘lganini, never esa hech qachon bo‘lmaganini aytadi: Have you ever flown?"},{"id":"en-a2-12-recap-0","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Majburiyat, taqiq va erkin tanlov: Shart emas, lekin mumkin degan gap?","answers":["You do not have to bring a notebook."],"explanation":"Don’t have to erkin tanlov.","hint":"have to wear / mustn’t touch / don’t have to bring","options":["You do not have to bring a notebook.","You must not bring a notebook.","You cannot bring a notebook."],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Majburiyat, taqiq va erkin tanlov"},{"id":"en-a2-12-recap-1","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Should va odobli so‘rovlar: Odobli so‘rovni tanlang.","answers":["Could you explain this, please?"],"explanation":"Could you … please? so‘rov.","hint":"You should … / Could you …, please? / Would you mind + -ing?","options":["Could you explain this, please?","You must explain now!","Explain me you?"],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Should va odobli so‘rovlar"},{"id":"en-a2-12-recap-2","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Present Perfect: tajriba va hozirgi natija: Hozirgi natijani tanlang.","answers":["I have lost my key, so I can’t open the door."],"explanation":"Have + lost hozirgi muammo bilan bog‘langan.","hint":"have/has + V3; have finished / has seen","options":["I have lost my key, so I can’t open the door.","I have lose my key.","I have lost yesterday my key (finished time)."],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Present Perfect: tajriba va hozirgi natija"}],"reading":{"title":"Ever, never, just, already va yet — vaziyat","text":"Lola has just arrived at school. Our group has already packed the maps and notebooks for the trip. Ali hasn’t called the bus company yet, so the teacher asks him to do it now. Most students have never visited Khiva. Aziz has been there once, but he has never travelled there with his classmates. The teacher asks, “Have you bought your tickets yet?” Everyone has a ticket except one student, who goes to the office to collect it.","sentences":["Lola has just arrived at school.","Our group has already packed the maps and notebooks for the trip.","Ali hasn’t called the bus company yet, so the teacher asks him to do it now.","Most students have never visited Khiva.","Aziz has been there once, but he has never travelled there with his classmates.","The teacher asks, “Have you bought your tickets yet?","” Everyone has a ticket except one student, who goes to the office to collect it."],"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-12-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Ali nima qilmagan?","answers":["called the bus company"],"explanation":"Hasn’t called … yet.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","options":["called the bus company","packed maps","arrived at school"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Ko‘pchilik Khivaga borganmi?","answers":["No"],"explanation":"Most students have never visited.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","options":["No","Yes, many times","Only yesterday"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","options":["Lola has just arrived at school.","Our group has already packed the maps and notebooks for the trip.","Ali hasn’t called the bus company yet, so the teacher asks him to do it now.","Most students have never visited Khiva.","Aziz has been there once, but he has never travelled there with his classmates.","The teacher asks, “Have you bought your tickets yet?","” Everyone has a ticket except one student, who goes to the office to collect it."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"I have just arrived. We have already packed the maps. Ali hasn’t called the bus company yet. Have you bought your ticket yet? Most students have never visited Khiva.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-12.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-12-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Xaritalar tayyormi?","answers":["Yes"],"explanation":"Already packed.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","options":["Yes","Not yet","They are lost"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Qo‘ng‘iroq qilinganmi?","answers":["Not yet"],"explanation":"Hasn’t called yet.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","options":["Not yet","Already","Just now"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["maps","Khiva"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","rows":["Tayyor buyumlar","Bormagan shahar"]},{"id":"en-a2-12-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["We have already packed our bags."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"have just finished / have already packed / haven’t called yet","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-12-dictation.mp3","transcript":"We have already packed our bags."}]},"writing":{"task":"Safar tayyorgarligini just/already/yet bilan tekshirish xabarini yozing.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":54,"maxWords":140,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"Hi Lola, I have just finished packing. I have already put my notebook and water bottle in my bag. I haven’t printed the timetable yet, but I will do it tonight. Have you bought your ticket yet? I have never visited Khiva, so I am excited to see the old city with our class.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["Have you ever visited Khiva?","I have never flown.","She has just arrived."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bi