vlar: Odobli so‘rovni tanlang.","answers":["Could you explain this, please?"],"explanation":"Could you … please? so‘rov.","hint":"You should … / Could you …, please? / Would you mind + -ing?","options":["Could you explain this, please?","You must explain now!","Explain me you?"],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Should va odobli so‘rovlar"},{"id":"en-a2-12-recap-2","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Present Perfect: tajriba va hozirgi natija: Hozirgi natijani tanlang.","answers":["I have lost my key, so I can’t open the door."],"explanation":"Have + lost hozirgi muammo bilan bog‘langan.","hint":"have/has + V3; have finished / has seen","options":["I have lost my key, so I can’t open the door.","I have lose my key.","I have lost yesterday my key (finished time)."],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Present Perfect: tajriba va hozirgi natija"}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-a2-13','en-a2-13',null,2,13,'published',1,'{"id":"en-a2-13","baseId":"en-a2-13","revision":1,"level":"A2","levelIndex":2,"order":13,"title":"Since, for va o‘tgan vaqtni tanlash","objective":"Davomiylikni boshlanish nuqtasidan ajratasiz va Perfect/Simple ni mos tanlaysiz.","context":"To‘garak a’zoligi va kechagi uchrashuv haqida yoziladi.","prerequisites":["en-a2-12"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang.","Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple.","Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring."],"pattern":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","examples":["I have lived here for two years.","She has known Ali since 2024.","We met yesterday.","I joined the club last year.","I have been to Bukhara.","He has gone to the library."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-a2-13-v0","term":"since","meaning":"… dan beri","ipa":"/sɪns/","collocation":"since Monday","example":"She has known Ali since 2024."},{"id":"en-a2-13-v1","term":"for","meaning":"davomida","ipa":"/fɔː/","collocation":"for two years","example":"I have lived here for two years."},{"id":"en-a2-13-v2","term":"join","meaning":"qo‘shilmoq","ipa":"/dʒɔɪn/","collocation":"join a club","example":"I joined the club last year."},{"id":"en-a2-13-v3","term":"member","meaning":"a’zo","ipa":"/ˈmembə/","collocation":"a club member","example":"I have been a member for twelve months, and I have known our teacher since September."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"timeline","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","I have lived here for two years.","She has known Ali since 2024."],"timeline":[{"why":"For two years boshlanishdan hozirgacha davomiylikni beradi. Grafikdagi uzunlik kunlar soni emas.","events":[{"kind":"span","from":110,"to":320,"label":"Ikki yil davomida — hozirgacha"}]},{"why":"Since 2024 boshlanish nuqtasi. Tanishlik hozirgacha davom etadi.","events":[{"kind":"span","from":95,"to":320,"label":"2024-yildan hozirgacha"}]}]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["To‘garak a’zoligi va kechagi uchrashuv haqida yoziladi.","We met yesterday.","I have been to Bukhara."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"I joined the club last year.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-13-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-a2-13-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Tugallangan vaqt uchun mos gap?","answers":["We met yesterday."],"explanation":"Yesterday bilan Past Simple.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["We met yesterday.","We have met yesterday.","We has met yesterday."]},{"id":"en-a2-13-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I have known her ___ 2024.","answers":["since"],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday"},{"id":"en-a2-13-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["I have lived here for two years."],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","tokens":["I","have","lived","here","for","two","years."]},{"id":"en-a2-13-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I have lived here since two years.","answers":["I have lived here for two years."],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday"},{"id":"en-a2-13-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["… dan beri","davomida","qo‘shilmoq","a’zo"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","left":["since","for","join","member"],"options":["… dan beri","davomida","qo‘shilmoq","a’zo"]}],"reading":{"title":"Since, for va o‘tgan vaqtni tanlash — vaziyat","text":"I joined our English club last year. I have been a member for twelve months, and I have known our teacher since September. Yesterday we met in the library and discussed a travel story. I have been to Bukhara, so I shared one memory. Ali has gone to the library now to return a book; he will come back later. Our group has studied together since autumn, but we did not meet during the school holiday.","sentences":["I joined our English club last year.","I have been a member for twelve months, and I have known our teacher since September.","Yesterday we met in the library and discussed a travel story.","I have been to Bukhara, so I shared one memory.","Ali has gone to the library now to return a book; he will come back later.","Our group has studied together since autumn, but we did not meet during the school holiday."],"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-13-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Kecha nima qilishdi?","answers":["discussed a travel story"],"explanation":"Yesterday … discussed — tugallangan voqea.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["discussed a travel story","joined a new club","travelled to Bukhara"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Ali hozir qayerga ketgan?","answers":["the library"],"explanation":"Has gone to the library, keyin qaytadi.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["the library","Bukhara","the park"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["I joined our English club last year.","I have been a member for twelve months, and I have known our teacher since September.","Yesterday we met in the library and discussed a travel story.","I have been to Bukhara, so I shared one memory.","Ali has gone to the library now to return a book; he will come back later.","Our group has studied together since autumn, but we did not meet during the school holiday."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"I have been in the club for twelve months. I have known the teacher since September. We met yesterday. Ali has gone to the library and will come back later.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-13.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-13-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"A’zolik muddati qancha?","answers":["twelve months"],"explanation":"For twelve months.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["twelve months","two weeks","six years"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Ustozni qachondan taniydi?","answers":["September"],"explanation":"Since September.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["September","yesterday","last night"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["twelve months","September"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","rows":["Muddat","Boshlanish"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["I joined the club last year."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-13-dictation.mp3","transcript":"I joined the club last year."}]},"writing":{"task":"Bir mashg‘ulotga qachon qo‘shilganingiz va qancha vaqtdan beri qatnashayotganingizni yozing.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":55,"maxWords":140,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"I joined the reading club last September. I have been a member for a year. I have known our teacher since the first meeting. Yesterday we discussed a story about a journey. I have been to Bukhara once, so I shared a memory. Our group has learned many useful words, and I still enjoy the meetings.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["I have lived here for two years.","She has known Ali since 2024.","We met yesterday."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"For va since bilan ikki davomiylikni ayting, keyin aniq o‘tgan kun voqeasini qo‘shing.","seconds":50,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Bir mashg‘ulotga qachon qo‘shilganingiz va qancha vaqtdan beri qatnashayotganingizni yozing.","exit":[[{"id":"en-a2-13-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"___ two years","answers":["for"],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday"},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"___ Monday","answers":["since"],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday"},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit2","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I ___ the club last year. (join)","answers":["joined"],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday"},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gone to nimani bildirishi mumkin?","answers":["away there now"],"explanation":"Kontekstda hali qaytmagan.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["away there now","always returned","never visited"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit4","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Been to tajriba gapimi?","answers":["Yes"],"explanation":"Borib ko‘rgan tajribasi.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["Yes","No","Only a future plan"]}],[{"id":"en-a2-13-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["She has known Ali since 2024."],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","tokens":["She","has","known","Ali","since","2024."]},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"___ Monday","answers":["since"],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday"},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["I joined the club last year."],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","tokens":["I","joined","the","club","last","year."]},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gone to nimani bildirishi mumkin?","answers":["away there now"],"explanation":"Kontekstda hali qaytmagan.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["away there now","always returned","never visited"]},{"id":"en-a2-13-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["He has gone to the library."],"explanation":"For davomiy muddat: for two years. Since boshlanish nuqtasi: since 2024. Bularni bir-birining o‘rnida ishlatmang. Hali davom etayotgan holatda Present Perfect: I have lived here for two years. Kechagi tugallangan voqeada Past Simple. Have been to — borib ko‘rgan, qaytgan tajriba. Have gone to — hozir u yerga ketgan degan farqni kontekstda tekshiring.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","tokens":["He","has","gone","to","the","library."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framewor