A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-a2-18","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":true,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-b1-01','en-b1-01',null,3,1,'published',1,'{"id":"en-b1-01","baseId":"en-b1-01","revision":1,"level":"B1","levelIndex":3,"order":1,"title":"Zamonni vaziyatga qarab tanlash","objective":"Odat, hozirgi jarayon, o‘tgan voqea va hozirgi natijani bir xabarda ajratasiz.","context":"Ko‘ngilli o‘quvchi maktab kutubxonasidagi ishini tasvirlaydi.","prerequisites":["en-a2-18"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped.","Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang.","Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring."],"pattern":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","examples":["I help in the library every Friday.","Today I am checking the books.","Yesterday we moved two shelves.","We have finished the first shelf.","I know where the books belong.","Lola has gone to the office."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-b1-01-v0","term":"volunteer","meaning":"ko‘ngilli","ipa":"/ˌvɒlənˈtɪə/","collocation":"work as a volunteer","example":"A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time."},{"id":"en-b1-01-v1","term":"shelf","meaning":"tokcha","ipa":"/ʃelf/","collocation":"move a shelf","example":"We have finished the first shelf."},{"id":"en-b1-01-v2","term":"belong","meaning":"tegishli bo‘lmoq","ipa":"/bɪˈlɒŋ/","collocation":"belong on a shelf","example":"I know where the books belong."},{"id":"en-b1-01-v3","term":"check","meaning":"tekshirmoq","ipa":"/tʃek/","collocation":"check a list","example":"Today I am checking the books."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"timeline","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","I help in the library every Friday.","Today I am checking the books."],"timeline":[{"why":"Every Friday muntazam odat. Present Simple bitta ayni damdagi voqea bilan cheklanmaydi.","events":[{"kind":"repeat","from":70,"to":570,"label":"Juma kunlarida takrorlanadi"}]},{"why":"Today I am checking vaqtinchalik bugungi jarayonni ajratadi.","events":[{"kind":"span","from":260,"to":380,"label":"Bugungi tekshirish jarayoni"}]}]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Ko‘ngilli o‘quvchi maktab kutubxonasidagi ishini tasvirlaydi.","Yesterday we moved two shelves.","I know where the books belong."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"We have finished the first shelf.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-01-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-b1-01-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Hozirgi natijaga mos gap?","answers":["We have finished the first shelf."],"explanation":"Natija hozirgi ishga bog‘liq.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["We have finished the first shelf.","We have finish yesterday.","We were finish every Friday."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We ___ two shelves yesterday. (move)","answers":["moved"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["I help in the library every Friday."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["I","help","in","the","library","every","Friday."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We have finished it yesterday.","answers":["We finished it yesterday."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["ko‘ngilli","tokcha","tegishli bo‘lmoq","tekshirmoq"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","left":["volunteer","shelf","belong","check"],"options":["ko‘ngilli","tokcha","tegishli bo‘lmoq","tekshirmoq"]}],"reading":{"title":"Zamonni vaziyatga qarab tanlash — vaziyat","text":"I help in our school library every Friday. Usually, I return books to their shelves and help younger students find stories. This week we are changing the room, so today I am checking the labels instead. Yesterday we moved two shelves away from the window. We have finished the first shelf, but the second one still needs labels. Lola has gone to the office to print them. She will return soon. I know where most books belong because I have worked here for a year. A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time. He made two mistakes yesterday, but he understands the categories better now. Our teacher says that finishing quickly is less important than putting each book in a place readers can find. We are keeping a short record so that next week’s volunteers can continue our work.","sentences":["I help in our school library every Friday.","Usually, I return books to their shelves and help younger students find stories.","This week we are changing the room, so today I am checking the labels instead.","Yesterday we moved two shelves away from the window.","We have finished the first shelf, but the second one still needs labels.","Lola has gone to the office to print them.","She will return soon.","I know where most books belong because I have worked here for a year.","A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time.","He made two mistakes yesterday, but he understands the categories better now.","Our teacher says that finishing quickly is less important than putting each book in a place readers can find.","We are keeping a short record so that next week’s volunteers can continue our work."],"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-01-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Bugun nega odatdagi ishini qilmayapti?","answers":["the room is being changed"],"explanation":"This week roomni o‘zgartirishmoqda; bugungi vazifa boshqa.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["the room is being changed","the library has closed forever","he dislikes younger students"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Nima tezlikdan muhimroq deb aytiladi?","answers":["putting books where readers can find them"],"explanation":"Ustoz ish maqsadini aniqlik bilan bog‘laydi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["putting books where readers can find them","printing more labels than needed","avoiding records"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["I help in our school library every Friday.","Usually, I return books to their shelves and help younger students find stories.","This week we are changing the room, so today I am checking the labels instead.","Yesterday we moved two shelves away from the window.","We have finished the first shelf, but the second one still needs labels.","Lola has gone to the office to print them.","She will return soon.","I know where most books belong because I have worked here for a year.","A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time.","He made two mistakes yesterday, but he understands the categories better now.","Our teacher says that finishing quickly is less important than putting each book in a place readers can find.","We are keeping a short record so that next week’s volunteers can continue our work."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"I usually help in the library on Fridays. Today I am checking labels because we are changing the room. We moved two shelves yesterday. We have finished one shelf. Lola has gone to the office to print the remaining labels, and she will return soon.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-01.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-01-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Lola qaytganmi?","answers":["not yet"],"explanation":"Has gone va will return hali qaytmaganini ko‘rsatadi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["not yet","she returned yesterday","she has never left"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Nechta tokcha tugadi?","answers":["one"],"explanation":"Finished one shelf.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["one","two","none"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["Fridays","checking labels"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","rows":["Odatdagi kun","Bugungi vazifa"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["We have finished the first shelf."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-01-dictation.mp3","transcript":"We have finished the first shelf."}]},"writing":{"task":"Doimiy vazifangiz, bugungi ishingiz, kechagi o‘zgarish va hozirgi natijani bitta xabarda tushuntiring.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":90,"maxWords":220,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"I usually help in the school library on Fridays. I put returned books on the shelves and show younger students where to look. Today I am checking labels because we are changing the room. Yesterday we moved two shelves to make more space near the window. We have finished one section, but we still need labels for the other. My friend has gone to the office to print them. I know most categories now, although I made mistakes when I first started. We are keeping a short record so that the next group can continue the work without confusion.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["I help in the library every Friday.","Today I am checking the books.","Yesterday we moved two shelves."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"Bir faoliyatingizni to‘rt vaqt nuqtasidan tasvirlang va sherigingizning aniqlashtiruvchi savoliga javob bering.","seconds":75,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Doimiy vazifangiz, bugungi ishingiz, kechagi o‘zgarish va hozirgi natijani bitta xabarda tushuntiring.","exit":[[{"id":"en-b1-01-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I ___ in the library every Friday. (help)","answers":["help"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Today I am ___ labels. (check)","answers":["checking"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit2","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Yesterday we ___ the shelves. (move)","answers":["moved"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Lola has gone to the office. U qayerda bo‘lishi mumkin?","answers":["away at the office"],"explanation":"Gone hozir ketganligini bildiradi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["away at the office","back here already","never at the office"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit4","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Holat fe’lini tanlang.","answers":["I know the system."],"explanation":"Know odatda simple.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["I know the system.","I am knowing the system.","I knowed the system."]}],[{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Today I am checking the books."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["Today","I","am","checking","the","books."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Today I am ___ labels. (check)","answers":["checking"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We have finished the first shelf."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["We","have","finished","the","first","shelf."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Lola has gone to the office. U qayerda bo‘lishi mumkin?","answers":["away at the office"],"explanation":"Gone hozir ketganligini bildiradi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["away at the office","back here already","never at the office"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Lola has gone to the office."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["Lola","has","gone","to","the","office."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xshash misol yozing.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-read","name":"British Council — Reading","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"reading","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading","task":"O‘z darajangizdagi matnni tanlang; asosiy fikr va bitta dalilni ajrating.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-write","name":"British Council — Writing","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"writing","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/writing","task":"Darajangizdagi namunaning kirish, asosiy qism va yakunini tahlil qiling.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-speak","name":"British Council — Speaking (A1–B2)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2"],"skill":"speaking","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/speaking","task":"Darajangizdagi video vaziyatidan ikki iborani o‘z dialogingizda ishlating.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-listen","name":"British Council — Listening (A1–C1)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"listening","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening","task":"Mos daraja audiosini transkriptsiz tinglang; keyin yozuv bilan tekshiring.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"cambridge","name":"Cambridge English — Activities","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"integrated","url":"https://www.cambridgeenglish.org/learning-english/activities-for-learners/","task":"A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":false,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-b1-02','en-b1-02',null,3,2,'published',1,'{"id":"en-b1-02","baseId":"en-b1-02","revision":1,"level":"B1","levelIndex":3,"order":2,"title":"Present Perfect Continuous: jarayon va davomiylik","objective":"Yaqindan beri davom etayotgan faoliyatni natijadan ajratasiz.","context":"O‘quvchilar loyiha ustida uzoq vaqt ishlagani va nimalarni tugatganini solishtiradi.","prerequisites":["en-b1-01"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour.","Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi.","Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin."],"pattern":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","examples":["We have been working for an hour.","I have written three pages.","She has been learning English since spring.","He has been running, so he is tired.","I have known her for years.","How long have you been waiting?"],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-b1-02-v0","term":"progress","meaning":"rivojlanish","ipa":"/ˈprəʊɡres/","collocation":"make progress","example":"Still, we can see real progress: we have collected useful stories, and our map shows where each one happened."},{"id":"en-b1-02-v1","term":"wait","meaning":"kutmoq","ipa":"/weɪt/","collocation":"wait for a friend","example":"How long have you been waiting?"},{"id":"en-b1-02-v2","term":"since","meaning":"… dan beri","ipa":"/sɪns/","collocation":"since spring","example":"She has been learning English since spring."},{"id":"en-b1-02-v3","term":"result","meaning":"natija","ipa":"/rɪˈzʌlt/","collocation":"a clear result","example":"a clear result"}],"visuals":[{"kind":"timeline","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["have been working for an hour / have written three pages","We have been working for an hour.","I have written three pages."],"timeline":[{"why":"Have been working oldin boshlangan jarayonni hozir bilan bog‘laydi; u davom etayotgan yoki yaqinda tugagan bo‘lishi mumkin.","events":[{"kind":"span","from":100,"to":320,"label":"Bir soat davomida ishlash"}]},{"why":"Have written three pages jarayonning sonli natijasini ko‘rsatadi. Hozir uch sahifa tayyor.","events":[{"kind":"point","x":230,"label":"Uch sahifa yozilgan"},{"kind":"link","from":230,"to":320,"label":"Hozirgi natija"}]}]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["O‘quvchilar loyiha ustida uzoq vaqt ishlagani va nimalarni tugatganini solishtiradi.","She has been learning English since spring.","I have known her for years."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"He has been running, so he is tired.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-02-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-b1-02-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Jarayonga urg‘u beradigan gapni tanlang.","answers":["I have been writing all morning."],"explanation":"Been writing jarayon.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["I have been writing all morning.","I have written three pages.","I wrote last year."]},{"id":"en-b1-02-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"She has ___ learning since spring.","answers":["been"],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages"},{"id":"en-b1-02-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["We have been working for an hour."],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","tokens":["We","have","been","working","for","an","hour."]},{"id":"en-b1-02-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I have been knowing her for years.","answers":["I have known her for years."],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages"},{"id":"en-b1-02-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["rivojlanish","kutmoq","… dan beri","natija"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","left":["progress","wait","since","result"],"options":["rivojlanish","kutmoq","… dan beri","natija"]}],"reading":{"title":"Present Perfect Continuous: jarayon va davomiylik — vaziyat","text":"Our group has been working on a local history project for two weeks. We have interviewed three neighbours and written six short reports. Ali has been checking dates since Monday, while Lola has been drawing a map. The map is not finished yet, but she has completed the main streets. We have been learning how to ask clearer questions. At first, our interviews were too long and did not have a clear purpose. Now we choose two important questions before each visit. Our teacher has known one of the neighbours for years and helped us arrange a meeting. Today we are tired because we have been walking around the town all morning. Still, we can see real progress: we have collected useful stories, and our map shows where each one happened. We plan to stop for the day and compare the reports tomorrow.","sentences":["Our group has been working on a local history project for two weeks.","We have interviewed three neighbours and written six short reports.","Ali has been checking dates since Monday, while Lola has been drawing a map.","The map is not finished yet, but she has completed the main streets.","We have been learning how to ask clearer questions.","At first, our interviews were too long and did not have a clear purpose.","Now we choose two important questions before each visit.","Our teacher has known one of the neighbours for years and helped us arrange a meeting.","Today we are tired because we have been walking around the town all morning.","Still, we can see real progress: we have collected useful stories, and our map shows where each one happened.","We plan to stop for the day and compare the reports tomorrow."],"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-02-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Six reports qaysi jihatni ta’kidlaydi?","answers":["a completed amount"],"explanation":"Have written six — tugallangan miqdor.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["a completed amount","only the duration","a future plan"]},{"id":"en-b1-02-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Nega charchagan?","answers":["they have been walking all morning"],"explanation":"Jarayon ko‘rinadigan hozirgi natijaga bog‘langan.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["they have been walking all morning","they have not slept for a month","the map is complete"]},{"id":"en-b1-02-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["Our group has been working on a local history project for two weeks.","We have interviewed three neighbours and written six short reports.","Ali has been checking dates since Monday, while Lola has been drawing a map.","The map is not finished yet, but she has completed the main streets.","We have been learning how to ask clearer questions.","At first, our interviews were too long and did not have a clear purpose.","Now we choose two important questions before each visit.","Our teacher has known one of the neighbours for years and helped us arrange a meeting.","Today we are tired because we have been walking around the town all morning.","Still, we can see real progress: we have collected useful stories, and our map shows where each one happened.","We plan to stop for the day and compare the reports tomorrow."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"We have been working for two weeks. We have written six reports and interviewed three neighbours. Lola has been drawing the map, but it is not finished. We are tired because we have been walking all morning.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-02.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-02-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tayyor hisobot soni?","answers":["six"],"explanation":"Written six reports.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["six","two","three"]},{"id":"en-b1-02-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Xarita tugaganmi?","answers":["No"],"explanation":"Not finished.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["No","Yes","It was never started"]},{"id":"en-b1-02-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["two weeks","six"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","rows":["Ish muddati","Hisobotlar"]},{"id":"en-b1-02-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["He has been running, so he is tired."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-02-dictation.mp3","transcript":"He has been running, so he is tired."}]},"writing":{"task":"Loyihangiz davomiyligi va tugallangan natijalarini alohida ko‘rsatib hisobot yozing.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":90,"maxWords":220,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"We have been preparing a school exhibition for two weeks. I have written four short descriptions, and my friend has taken ten photos. She has been choosing the best pictures since Monday. We have not finished the display yet, but the main title is ready. I have been learning to check dates carefully because one of our first descriptions had a mistake. Our teacher has known the local guide for years, and the guide has helped us find reliable information. Today we are tired because we have been moving tables all morning. We will compare the remaining texts tomorrow before printing them.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["We have been working for an hour.","I have written three pages.","She has been learning English since spring."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"How long …? va How many …? savollariga mos ikki shaklda javob bering.","seconds":75,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Loyihangiz davomiyligi va tugallangan natijalarini alohida ko‘rsatib hisobot yozing.","exit":[[{"id":"en-b1-02-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We have been ___ for an hour. (work)","answers":["working"],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages"},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I have ___ three pages. (write)","answers":["written"],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages"},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit2","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"How long have you ___ waiting?","answers":["been"],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages"},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Aniq tugallangan miqdor qaysi?","answers":["I have written six reports."],"explanation":"Six reports natijani o‘lchaydi.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["I have written six reports.","I have been writing.","I am writing."]},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit4","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Know uchun odatiy shakl?","answers":["have known"],"explanation":"Holat fe’li.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["have known","have been knowing","has knowing"]}],[{"id":"en-b1-02-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["I have written three pages."],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","tokens":["I","have","written","three","pages."]},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I have ___ three pages. (write)","answers":["written"],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages"},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["He has been running, so he is tired."],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","tokens":["He","has","been","running,","so","he","is","tired."]},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Aniq tugallangan miqdor qaysi?","answers":["I have written six reports."],"explanation":"Six reports natijani o‘lchaydi.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","options":["I have written six reports.","I have been writing.","I am writing."]},{"id":"en-b1-02-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["How long have you been waiting?"],"explanation":"Have/has been + -ing davom etgan faoliyatga e’tibor beradi: We have been working for an hour. Have written three pages aniq tugallangan miqdorni aytadi. Have been writing jarayon va sarflangan vaqtni ta’kidlaydi. Holat fe’llarida ko‘pincha perfect simple: I have known her for years. Doimiyligi ko‘rinadigan natija bilan bog‘langan jarayon hozir to‘xtagan bo‘lishi ham mumkin.","hint":"have been working for an hour / have written three pages","tokens":["How","long","have","you","been","waiting?"]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xshash misol yozing.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-read","name":"British Council — Reading","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"reading","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading","task":"O‘z darajangizdagi matnni tanlang; asosiy fikr va bitta dalilni ajrating.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-write","name":"British Council — Writing","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"writing","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/writing","task":"Darajangizdagi namunaning kirish, asosiy qism va yakunini tahlil qiling.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-speak","name":"British Council — Speaking (A1–B2)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2"],"skill":"speaking","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/speaking","task":"Darajangizdagi video vaziyatidan ikki iborani o‘z dialogingizda ishlating.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-listen","name":"British Council — Listening (A1–C1)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"listening","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening","task":"Mos daraja audiosini transkriptsiz tinglang; keyin yozuv bilan tekshiring.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"cambridge","name":"Cambridge English — Activities","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"integrated","url":"https://www.cambridgeenglish.org/learning-english/activities-for-learners/","task":"A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-b1-02","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":false,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-b1-03','en-b1-03',null,3,3,'published',1,'{"id":"en-b1-03","baseId":"en-b1-03","revision":1,"level":"B1","levelIndex":3,"order":3,"title":"Hikoya zamonlari va Past Perfect","objective":"Hikoyadagi avval, davom va asosiy voqeani aniq tartiblaysiz.","context":"Uchrashuvga kelganingizda nima avval bo‘lib o‘tganini tushuntirasiz.","prerequisites":["en-b1-02"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi.","Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left.","Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating."],"pattern":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","examples":["When I arrived, the bus had left.","Lola was waiting outside.","She had checked the timetable.","We called the teacher.","I hadn’t saved the message.","After we had spoken, we chose another route."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-b1-03-v0","term":"route","meaning":"yo‘nalish","ipa":"/ruːt/","collocation":"another route","example":"After we had spoken, we chose another route."},{"id":"en-b1-03-v1","term":"timetable","meaning":"jadval","ipa":"/ˈtaɪmteɪbəl/","collocation":"check a timetable","example":"She had checked the timetable."},{"id":"en-b1-03-v2","term":"miss","meaning":"ulgurmay qolmoq","ipa":"/mɪs/","collocation":"miss a bus","example":"He had missed the message too."},{"id":"en-b1-03-v3","term":"earlier","meaning":"oldinroq","ipa":"/ˈɜːliə/","collocation":"leave earlier","example":"leave earlier"}],"visuals":[{"kind":"timeline","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","When I arrived, the bus had left.","Lola was waiting outside."],"timeline":[{"why":"Had left voqeasi arriveddan oldin sodir bo‘lgan. Ikkala voqea ham hozirdan oldin.","events":[{"kind":"point","x":95,"label":"Avtobus ketgan"},{"kind":"point","x":210,"label":"Men yetib kelganman"}]},{"why":"Was waiting hikoyadagi o‘tgan paytda davom etayotgan holat. Aniq davomiylik berilmagan.","events":[{"kind":"span","from":75,"to":245,"label":"O‘tgan paytdagi kutish"}]}]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Uchrashuvga kelganingizda nima avval bo‘lib o‘tganini tushuntirasiz.","She had checked the timetable.","I hadn’t saved the message."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"We called the teacher.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-03-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-b1-03-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Avvalgi o‘tmish voqeasini tanlang.","answers":["The bus had left before I arrived."],"explanation":"Had left oldingi nuqta.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["The bus had left before I arrived.","The bus will leave yesterday.","The bus has left yesterday at nine."]},{"id":"en-b1-03-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"When I arrived, the bus ___ left.","answers":["had"],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier"},{"id":"en-b1-03-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["When I arrived, the bus had left."],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","tokens":["When","I","arrived,","the","bus","had","left."]},{"id":"en-b1-03-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"She had went home.","answers":["She had gone home."],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier"},{"id":"en-b1-03-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["yo‘nalish","jadval","ulgurmay qolmoq","oldinroq"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","left":["route","timetable","miss","earlier"],"options":["yo‘nalish","jadval","ulgurmay qolmoq","oldinroq"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-collocations","type":"collocation","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni darsdagi birikmasi bilan moslang.","left":["route","timetable","miss","earlier"],"options":["another route","check a timetable","miss a bus","leave earlier"],"answers":["another route","check a timetable","miss a bus","leave earlier"],"hint":"So‘z qaysi birikmada ishlatilishini eslang.","explanation":"Birikmani yozgan gapingizda ham ishlating."}],"reading":{"title":"Hikoya zamonlari va Past Perfect — vaziyat","text":"I arrived at the station at nine, but the school bus had already left. Lola was waiting outside the ticket office. She had checked the timetable and knew that a public bus would leave in twenty minutes. I had not saved the teacher’s message, so I did not know the school bus was leaving early. We called the teacher and explained the mistake. While we were talking, another classmate arrived. He had missed the message too. The teacher did not ask us to rush across the city. Instead, she told us to take the public bus and meet the group at the museum entrance. We bought tickets, checked the route, and arrived safely. Later I saved the meeting information in my calendar. The problem taught me to check an arrangement before the day of the trip, not only when I reached the station.","sentences":["I arrived at the station at nine, but the school bus had already left.","Lola was waiting outside the ticket office.","She had checked the timetable and knew that a public bus would leave in twenty minutes.","I had not saved the teacher’s message, so I did not know the school bus was leaving early.","We called the teacher and explained the mistake.","While we were talking, another classmate arrived.","He had missed the message too.","The teacher did not ask us to rush across the city.","Instead, she told us to take the public bus and meet the group at the museum entrance.","We bought tickets, checked the route, and arrived safely.","Later I saved the meeting information in my calendar.","The problem taught me to check an arrangement before the day of the trip, not only when I reached the station."],"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-03-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Avtobus so‘zlovchidan oldin ketganini qaysi shakl ko‘rsatadi?","answers":["had already left"],"explanation":"Had left boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldin.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["had already left","was waiting","arrived safely"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Xulosa nima?","answers":["check arrangements in advance"],"explanation":"Oxirgi gap oldindan tekshirish sabog‘ini beradi.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["check arrangements in advance","always run across the city","never use public transport"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["I arrived at the station at nine, but the school bus had already left.","Lola was waiting outside the ticket office.","She had checked the timetable and knew that a public bus would leave in twenty minutes.","I had not saved the teacher’s message, so I did not know the school bus was leaving early.","We called the teacher and explained the mistake.","While we were talking, another classmate arrived.","He had missed the message too.","The teacher did not ask us to rush across the city.","Instead, she told us to take the public bus and meet the group at the museum entrance.","We bought tickets, checked the route, and arrived safely.","Later I saved the meeting information in my calendar.","The problem taught me to check an arrangement before the day of the trip, not only when I reached the station."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"When I arrived at nine, the school bus had left. Lola was waiting outside. She had checked the timetable. A public bus was leaving in twenty minutes. We called our teacher and agreed to meet at the museum.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-03.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-03-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"So‘zlovchi nechada kelgan?","answers":["nine"],"explanation":"Arrived at nine.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["nine","eight","ten"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Keyingi avtobus qancha vaqtda?","answers":["twenty minutes"],"explanation":"In twenty minutes.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["twenty minutes","an hour","five minutes"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["nine","museum"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","rows":["Kelish soati","Yangi uchrashuv joyi"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["We called the teacher."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-03-dictation.mp3","transcript":"We called the teacher."}]},"writing":{"task":"Kichik tushunmovchilik haqidagi hikoyani yozing; kamida bir avvalgi voqea va bir fon harakatni ko‘rsating.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":90,"maxWords":220,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"I reached the library at four, but my friend had already left. I had written the wrong time in my notebook. Another student was waiting near the door and told me that the meeting had finished at three. I called my friend and explained the mistake. While we were talking, the librarian found the worksheet I needed. My friend had left it for me, so I could still do the task. I thanked them both and checked the next meeting time carefully. Since then, I have put important arrangements in my calendar and read them again the evening before.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["When I arrived, the bus had left.","Lola was waiting outside.","She had checked the timetable."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"Nima avval bo‘lganini sherigingiz tushunadigan tartibda hikoya qiling.","seconds":75,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Kichik tushunmovchilik haqidagi hikoyani yozing; kamida bir avvalgi voqea va bir fon harakatni ko‘rsating.","exit":[[{"id":"en-b1-03-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"She had ___ the timetable. (check)","answers":["checked"],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier"},{"id":"en-b1-03-exit1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We were ___ outside. (wait)","answers":["waiting"],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier"},{"id":"en-b1-03-exit2","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I ___ the teacher yesterday. (call)","answers":["called"],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pincha yetarli; avvalgi voqeani alohida ko‘rsatmoqchi bo‘lsangiz had + V3 ishlating.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier"},{"id":"en-b1-03-exit3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Past Perfect tuzilmasi?","answers":["had + V3"],"explanation":"Had + past participle.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["had + V3","was + base verb","did + V3"]},{"id":"en-b1-03-exit4","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Hikoyadagi hamma gapga had kerakmi?","answers":["No"],"explanation":"Aniq ketma-ketlikda Past Simple yetishi mumkin.","hint":"When I arrived, the bus had left. / was waiting → arrived → had left earlier","options":["No","Yes","Always"]}],[{"id":"en-b1-03-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Lola was waiting outside."],"explanation":"Past Simple hikoyani oldinga yuritadi; Past Continuous fondagi jarayonni ko‘rsatadi. Had + V3 boshqa o‘tmish nuqtasidan oldingi voqea: When I arrived, the bus had left. Past Perfect har bir eski voqeaga kerak emas. Voqealar tartibi aniq bo‘lsa Past Simple ko‘pin