V3 kuchli xulosa, might have ehtimol. Can’t have dalilga zid natijani rad etadi; should have o‘tgan maslahat yoki tanqid. Didn’t need to bilan needn’t have done bir xil emas: ikkinchisida ish bajarilgan.","hint":"must have / might have / should have + V3","tokens":["We","should","have","checked","the","address."]},{"id":"en-b2-07-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Avvalgi qat’iy xulosa muammosi?","answers":["it exceeded the evidence"],"explanation":"Dalilsiz must have juda qat’iy.","hint":"must have / might have / should have + V3","options":["it exceeded the evidence","it was confirmed immediately","it had no grammar"]},{"id":"en-b2-07-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["The message may have gone to spam."],"explanation":"Must have + V3 kuchli xulosa, might have ehtimol. Can’t have dalilga zid natijani rad etadi; should have o‘tgan maslahat yoki tanqid. Didn’t need to bilan needn’t have done bir xil emas: ikkinchisida ish bajarilgan.","hint":"must have / might have / should have + V3","tokens":["The","message","may","have","gone","to","spam."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-b2-07","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-b2-07","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki 